  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Valero Marketing and Supply obligated $520M in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Valero Marketing and Supply received 109 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $4.8M. Valero Marketing and Supply obligations are down 55.9% year over year. Historical fiscal-year obligations show peaks and troughs: FY21 totaled $513M, FY22 totaled $1.4B, FY23 totaled $1.2B, FY24 totaled $1.1B, FY25 totaled $1.2B, and FY26 to date totaled $520M. Valero Marketing and Supply current-year totals are partial because the fiscal year is still in progress. Valero Marketing and Supply maintained a pipeline of awards that produced a smaller year-to-date total compared with the prior full fiscal years. Valero Marketing and Supply average award size of $4.8M indicates that contracts are generally mid-sized by federal procurement standards. The raw counts and dollar totals point to a materially lower pace of obligations so far in FY26 compared with the FY22 to FY25 period.",
